ModuleEmbeddedBookkeepingName=EmbeddedBookkeeping
ModuleEmbeddedBookkeepingDesc=Record bookkeeping entries directly from invoice cards (Xero/Odoo style), with optional AI account suggestion. Reuses llx_accounting_bookkeeping entirely — no schema changes, no core modifications. Compatible with Dolibarr 14.0 .. 22.0.x.
EmbeddedBookkeepingDescriptionLong=EmbeddedBookkeeping adds two buttons to customer and supplier invoice cards: "Record bookkeeping" (manual debit/credit entry) and "AI suggest entries" (LLM-assisted account pick). Both flows share a confirmation modal and produce a single balanced journal entry (one piece_num, two bookkeeping rows). AI provider can be the native Dolibarr ai module (chatgpt/groq/mistral/custom) or a direct Anthropic Claude Messages API call. All output is human-confirmed; nothing is auto-posted on invoice validation.
Module500200Name=EmbeddedBookkeeping
Module500200Desc=Record bookkeeping entries directly from invoice cards (Xero/Odoo style), with optional AI account suggestion. Compatible with Dolibarr 14.0 .. 22.0.x.

